					"content": "「正义人」先生，刚才究竟发生了什么呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4640511,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4640512,
					"content": "…是深渊教团。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4640513,
					"content": "又是他们？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4640514,
					"content": "不知最近又在盘算些什么鬼主意，像是在做前期侦察的样子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4640515,
					"content": "明明这段时间，他们的小动作已经被我识破很多次了…居然还不放弃。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640516,
						4640518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4640516,
					"content": "一直是你一个人在对付他们吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640517
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 4640517,
					"content": "算是吧，如果没有另一个什么「暗夜英雄」的话。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4640520,
					"content": "毕竟骑士团里大多是些派不上用场的家伙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4640521,
					"content": "怎么可能放心把背后交给他们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640522,
						4640524
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4640522,
					"content": "迪卢克真是厉害呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640523
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 4640523,
					"content": "我可不是为了获得称赞才做这些的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640526
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4640526,
					"content": "陪你们聊了这么久，不如你们也帮我个忙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640527
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4640527,
					"content": "咦？迪卢克老爷需要帮什么忙呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640528
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4640528,
					"content": "对我的身份保密。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640529
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4640529,
					"content": "尤其是<color=#00E1FFFF>别让骑士团的人知道了我的行动。</color>",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640530
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4640530,
					"content": "哒哒哒……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640531
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4640531,
					"content": "咦，什么声音？是深渊教团的援兵吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640532
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4640532,
					"content": "几个小角色而已，你应该也可以轻松解决。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640533
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4640533,
					"content": "我可不能被这些杂碎拖住了脚步，就麻烦你处理一下了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640534
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4640534,
					"content": "别忘了帮我保密的事，回见。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640535
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4640535,
					"content": "喂喂！你就这么走啦？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4640524,
					"content": "莫非你和骑士团有什么过节？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640525
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 4640525,
					"content": "只是些陈年旧事，没必要再提起。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640526
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4640518,
					"content": "为什么不请骑士团帮忙呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640519
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 4640519,
					"content": "哼，那样的话，就不知是谁帮谁的忙了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4640503,
					"content": "暗夜英雄居然就是迪卢克吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4640504
					]
				}
			]
